{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 374,
  "hub_id": 558,
  "guid": "com.bluehead.aiotrader",
  "name": "bluehead's AIO Trader",
  "slug": "blueheads-aio-trader",
  "teaser": "Buy everything from one trader. Get all keys with one command.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/558.png",
  "downloads": 144946,
  "favourites_count": 31,
  "description": "<h1>Installation</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>copy BlueheadsAIOTrader folder into [SPT_INSTALL_FOLDER]/SPT/user/mods</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Usage</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>buy everything in game database from AIOTrader</li>\n<li>get AIOKeysCase, AIOAmmoCase, encoded DSP Transmitter by send message to Commando, see how to use Commando[https://wiki.sp-tarkov.com/en/SPT_and_Commando_Bots]</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give key</code> to get a case include all key</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give ammo</code> to get a case include all ammo with 99999 stacked</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give dsp</code> to get a encoded DSP Transmitter</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Configuration</h1>\n<p>Edit BlueheadsAIOTrader/data/config.json</p>\n<pre><code>   enable_aiotrader: toggle trader\n   realistic_price.enable: toggle the realistic_price\n   custom_price: force aioTrader to sell specific items at the price you specify\n   hide_no_price_item: let aiotrader not sell items without realistic or custom price\n\n   hide_all_ammo_ammopacks: hide ammo &amp; ammopacks from aiotrader to make it load faster\n   hide_all_keys_cards: hide keys &amp; cards from aiotrader to make it load faster\n   hide_all_builtin_inserts: hide armor vest builtin inserts from aiotrader to make it load faster\n</code></pre>\n<h1>Changelog</h1>\n<h2>Version 5.0.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>update for spt 4.0.1</li>\n<li>BluheadTrader has been removed. The AIOKeyCase and AIOAmmoCase etc… are now provided via Commando commands for improved mod compatibility.</li>\n<li>get AIOKeysCase, AIOAmmoCase, encoded DSP Transmitter by send message to Commando, see how to use Commando[https://wiki.sp-tarkov.com/en/SPT_and_Commando_Bots]</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give key</code> to get a case include all key</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give ammo</code> to get a case include all ammo with 99999 stacked</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give dsp</code> to get a encoded DSP Transmitter</li>\n</ul>\n",
