      "version": "4.0.2",
      "description": "<p>update for apt 3.9.8</p>\n<p>Since Tarkov has more and more items, AIOTrader is loading slower and slower, so I optimized trader loading speed by:</p>\n<p>1. Remove all keys &amp; cards from AIOTrader since you can buy them from bluehead trader</p>\n<p>2. Remove all ammo &amp; ammo packs from AIOTrader since you can buy all ammo from bluehead trader</p>\n<p>3. Remove all built-in plates of armor vest from AIOTrader since you can not customize them anyway.</p>\n<p>4. Sell all mod parts separately in AIOTraderPart2</p>\n<p>5. All these features can be toggled via the config</p>\n<p>Let me know your thoughts on these changes by leaving a comment, good luck : )</p>\n",
